silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_05_validation_and_shapes_sections_01_shape_gate_olog_node_concrete_anchor_2 silm:hasExample "In 'ConcreteAnchor — 01_shape_gate_olog_node #2', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, In section 'Shape Gate as Olog Constraint Node' the bare symbol Shape anchors to CitedVetRecordObject: The vet-record after citation key local-mittens-example-anchor-2026 is assigned and its source boundary is declared: this file is about Mittens, not Mittens itself. Same physical document; different Forge standing.." .
